10. OOPS - OBJECT ORIENTED PROGRAMMING - FULL EXPLANATION
----------------------------------------------------------
OOPS = Real life in code.

Class = Blueprint / Design. Like house plan. House plan is not house, it is design.
Object = Real house made from plan. You can make many houses from one plan.
__init__ = Constructor - When you make object, __init__ runs automatically and saves values.
self = This object. self.name means this object's name.
Method = Function inside Class. Work of Class. Like show() = show balance.
Inheritance = Child gets Father's property + methods free. Child class (Parent).
Polymorphism = Same function name, different work in Parent and Child.

Parent + Child Full Code:
class BankAccount:  # Parent - Father
    def __init__(self, name, balance):
        self.name = name
        self.balance = balance
    def show(self):
        return f"{self.name} has {self.balance} rupees"

class SavingsAccount(BankAccount):  # Child - Son - Father is BankAccount
    def __init__(self, name, balance, interest):
        super().__init__(name, balance)  # Call Father __init__
        self.interest = interest
    def add_interest(self):  # Child Method 1
        self.balance = self.balance + self.interest
        return f"{self.name} new balance is {self.balance}"
    def show_interest(self):  # Child Method 2
        return f"{self.name} interest is {self.interest}"

# Object - Parent Object
a1 = BankAccount("Hyarel", 1000)
print(a1.show())  # Recall Father method

# Object - Child Object - Needs name, balance, interest
s1 = SavingsAccount("Priya", 1000, 100)
print(s1.show())  # Recall Father method - Free for Child
print(s1.add_interest())  # Recall Child Method 1
print(s1.show_interest())  # Recall Child Method 2

Output:
Hyarel has 1000 rupees
Priya has 1000 rupees
Priya new balance is 1100
Priya interest is 100

How OOPS works:
- BankAccount is Parent, SavingsAccount is Child.
- Child object s1 has 3 values - name, balance from Father + interest own.
- super().__init__ calls Father to save name, balance.
- s1.show() - Child uses Father's show free - Inheritance.
- s1.add_interest() - Child uses own method.


